   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Prisoners sit in the front of the prison during the visit of the special representative to the secretary genreal in Haiti Hedi Annabi's visit  in Gonaives after tropical storm Hanna passed through flooding the entire region killing more than 160 people and stranding thousands.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
